  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/636/armor-stand-arms-header.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"140\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>介紹</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您的原版遊戲體驗將因此功能而更加豐富——現在可以輕鬆快速地為所有盔甲架添加手臂。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需靠近已放置的盔甲架，並使用指令 <em><strong>/trigger armorstandarms</strong></em>，它就會為您生成手臂。請確保您與盔甲架的距離不超過 3 格。<em>此功能在伺服器端運作，客戶端無需安裝即可在伺服器上遊玩。</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/637/armor-stand-arms-screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一同遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
